Add three lines to the `pub mod` list, each in alphabetical place:
    pub mod annotations;    (first, before `pub mod codec;`)
    pub mod oplist;         (after `pub mod object;`)
    pub mod outline_read;   (after `pub mod oplist;`)
Add `annotations`, `oplist`, `outline_read` to the parenthesised module list of the crate doc comment if it is kept in step. Nothing is
